d average approach, considering the position between 6.14 and 6.62.\n\nThe weighted calculation yields 6.38, which represents the expected shortfall at the 95% confidence level. I'll update the answer accordingly, rounding to two decimal places as required.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_d7e6f98f247b41ec9c07c5cd","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/app/answer.txt","before":"6.36","after":"6.38"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
